	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Venit ad vos <persName ref="p8093">Hercules a Salicibus</persName>, quem ut <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tibi commendem, non est opus, cum iam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>antea commendatus sit et ex virtutibus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>suis notus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Proficiscitur hodie in <placeName>Genins</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ad <persName>Carlinum</persName>, mox inde ad vos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ardua <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>molitur; sed non nisi ardua vincunt.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Hunc tu ut consilio et re iuves, maximo<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>pere te rogo sicque mihi perusadeo te <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>earum rerum, quas ex te scire cupit, nihil plane <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>illum celaturum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Communis causa agitur <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>omnium.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Er wirt by üch erkundigen, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>was die Stett thun werdend und ob <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürych</placeName>, so man etwas ze handen nemme, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ein trüw uffsechen uff unsere land <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>haben wurde.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Ir wüssend ouch, das <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>man das korn durch und über der <placeName ref="l862">Schwytzer</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>erdtrich von <placeName ref="l587">Zürych</placeName> nacher fertigen muͦß.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Stunde daruff, sy verhübind dasselb.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Item so ist das gröst, wo man den baß haben <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>möge und wie.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Daa achten ich, das <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>der <persName>herr von Sax</persName> guͦtt zuͦ disen rädten <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>wäre.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Caetera omnia audies ex <persName ref="p8093">Hercule</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Ob gott wil, gebend die üweren den baß; <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ob gott wil, thuͦnd sy ein oug zuͦ und <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>lassend ouch ettliche louffen.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quid <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName>?</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Man sagt, sy habind inen die Ort den <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>paß abtrutzen laßen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Quod scripseram <persName>Carlinum</persName> missurum suo <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nomine, de eo scias nos consilium <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>mutasse; sufficit <persName ref="p8093">Hercules</persName>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Dum <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>haec scribo, accipimus literas a d. <persName ref="p3375">P[aulo] Vergerio</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l512">Thübinga</placeName> scriptas, quibus se incolumem <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>rediisse significat.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Cupit, ut scribamus <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>(sed frustra); se enim sperare, quod possit a <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>principe reditum ad <persName>Rhaetos</persName> impetrare.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Sed <persName ref="p3375">Vergerium</persName> mittamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Ut causam hanc iuves, te iterum iterumque rogo.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Vale, reverende in Christo pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName ref="l98">Curiae</placeName> 26. iunii anno 1562.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Non est, quod mandem, operam detis, <persName ref="p8093">Hercules</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>a magistratu magnifice pro merito <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>tractetur.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Scitis ipsi pro vestra <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>prudentia et humanitate, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>quomodo tales viri tractandi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Tui observans, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>quem nosti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Velim, si fieri posset et <persName ref="p8315">princeps <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>de Conde</persName> scriberet, aliquis <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>illorum etiam singulariter ad <lb xml:id="p2z20"/><persName>Carlinum</persName> scriberet, <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>ne videretur negligi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
